cial</strong>: You can only apply the effects of one critical feat to a given critical hit unless you possess Critical Mastery.</p><h3>Combat Trick</h3><p>When you deal bleed damage with this feat, you can spend up to 3 stamina points to increase the amount of bleed damage dealt by double the number of stamina points you spent.</p>","instructions":""},"tags":["Combat","Critical","Combat Trick"],"actions":[],"attackNotes":[],"effectNotes":[],"uses":{"value":null,"per":"","autoDeductChargesCost":"","maxFormula":"","rechargeFormula":""},"changes":[],"changeFlags":{"immuneToMorale":false,"loseDexToAC":false,"noMediumEncumbrance":false,"noHeavyEncumbrance":false,"mediumArmorFullSpeed":false,"heavyArmorFullSpeed":false,"lowLightVision":false,"seeInvisibility":false,"seeInDarkness":false},"contextNotes":[{"target":"critical","text":"[[/r 2d6]] bleed damage on critical hit with a slashing or piercing weapon"}],"links":{"children":[],"charges":[],"supplements":[]},"tag":"","armorProf":[],"weaponProf":[],"languages":[],"flags":{"boolean":{},"dictionary":{}},"scriptCalls":[],"subType":"feat","traitType":"","traitCategory":"","racePoints":null,"abilityType":"na","associations":{"classes":[]},"showInQuickbar":false,"crOffset":"","inherited":false,"acquired":false,"simple":false,"summons":false,"disabled":false,"classSkills":{},"sources":[{"id":"PZO1110","pages":"114, 118"}]},"type":"feat","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":112500,"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.pf1.feats.Item.K1BvVIrp30BUKQB5"}},"ownership":{"default":0}},{"_id":"YbALJ81x0bbFsWcy","_stats":{"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":"pf1","systemVersion":"11.11","createdTime":1795125196991,"modifiedTime":1795125199685,"lastModifiedBy":"C7TQ7ZOKBUpwNi2A"},"img":"systems/pf1/icons/feats/critical-focus.jpg","name":"Critical Focus","system":{"description":{"value":"<p><em>You are trained in the art of causing pain.</em></p><p><strong>Prerequisites</strong>: Base attack bonus +9.</p><p><strong>Benefits</strong>: You receive a +4 circumstance bonus on attack rolls made to confirm critical hits.</p><h3>Combat Trick</h3><p>If your successful critical confirmation roll is a natural 19 or 20, you can spend 2 stamina points to roll another confirmation roll. If this confirmation roll also succeeds, increase your critical multiplier by 1 for this attack, and you can roll again. If you continue to roll 19 or 20, you can continue to spend stamina points for additional rolls, and the increases to the critical multiplier stack.</p>","instructions":""},"tags":["Combat","Critical","Combat Trick"],"actions":[],"attackNotes":[],"effectNotes":[],"uses":{"value":null,"per":"","autoDeductChargesCost":"","maxFormula":"","rechargeFormula":""},"changes":[{"_id":"U3Bm4mlk","formula":"4","target":"critConfirm","type":"circumstance","operator":"add","priority":0}],"changeFlags":{"immuneToMorale":false,"loseDexToAC":false,"noMediumEncumbrance":false,"noHeavyEncumbrance":false,"mediumArmorFullSpeed":false,"heavyArmorFullSpeed":false,"lowLightVision":false,"seeInvisibility":false,"seeInDarkness":false},"contextNotes":[],"links":{"children":[],"charges":[],"supplements":[]},"tag":"","armorProf":[],"weaponProf":[],"languages":[],"flags":{"boolean":{},"dictionary":{}},"scriptCalls":[],"subType":"feat","traitType":"","traitCategory":"","racePoints":null,"abilityType":"na","associations":{"classes":[]},"showInQuickbar":false,"crOffset":"","inherited":false,"acquired":false,"simple":false,"summons":false,"disabled":false,"classSkills":{},"sources":[{"id":"PZO1110","pages":"114, 120"}]},"type":"feat","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":212500,"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.pf1.feats.Item.JNlMhMhcDO8wkXiw"},"pf1":{"migration":"11.11"}},"ownership":{"default":0}},{"_id":"k0XIKBj4yaZKLlIJ","_stats":{"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":"pf1","systemVersion":"11.11","createdTime":1795125197039,"modifiedTime":1795125199685,"lastModifiedBy":"C7TQ7ZOKBUpwNi2A"},"img":"systems/pf1/icons/feats/great-fortitude.jpg","na